Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.48,0:00:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,只要與你在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.27,0:00:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,無論哪裡都能去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.03,0:00:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你在唱什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.90,0:00:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,With
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.74,0:00:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,With是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.70,0:00:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,在英語裡是「一起」的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.41,0:00:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,原來是「一起」的意思嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.29,0:00:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你不知道意思就在唱嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.83,0:00:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,一起作為歌名嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.87,0:00:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,真奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.92,0:00:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,說到這個  我們也決定一下隊伍名吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.05,0:00:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,隊伍名?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.13,0:00:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,那個我已經想過了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.51,0:00:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,看
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.89,0:00:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,這是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.26,0:00:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,是鬍鬚貓啦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.60,0:00:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,那就這麼決定了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.14,0:00:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我們的隊伍名就叫…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.10,0:00:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,鬍鬚貓海鷗團
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.02,0:00:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,把海鷗去了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.82,0:00:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那就叫鬍鬚貓團
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.07,0:00:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,鷗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.71,0:01:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好重
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.63,0:01:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,喂  起床了  鷗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.34,0:01:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,要被做色色的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.89,0:01:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不會做啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.07,0:02:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,食物準備好了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.44,0:02:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,從良一那借來的露營工具也準備好了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.11,0:03:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,鷹原羽依里  聽令
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.53,0:03:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,在
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.20,0:03:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你的手已經沒事了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.49,0:03:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  如你所見
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.00,0:03:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼尋找海盜船大冒險
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.54,0:03:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,啟程!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.96,0:03:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.05,0:03:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,所以  接下來要怎麼走
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.09,0:03:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.68,0:03:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,往那邊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.61,0:03:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.95,0:03:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡就是起點吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.54,0:03:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,看來是的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.55,0:03:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,是叫with嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.34,0:04:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,這歌我以前好像也聽過
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.84,0:04:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.15,0:04:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉  我走得太慢了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.48,0:04:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,在鐵軌上帶著行李箱很不好走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.82,0:04:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,倒也不至於
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.49,0:04:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我出發前已經把輪子改成山地輪了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.33,0:04:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,是  是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.66,0:04:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我來幫你提吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.87,0:04:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.21,0:04:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.96,0:04:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.92,0:04:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,以前也是…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.51,0:04:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我以前也總是給大家添麻煩
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.93,0:04:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,只有我走得很慢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.14,0:04:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.47,0:04:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,但是別放在心上
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.52,0:04:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,慢慢地一邊回憶著往事一邊走
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.02,0:04:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不也挺好的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.23,0:04:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,羽依里…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.73,0:04:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,羽依里is好人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.69,0:05:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,快別這麼說了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.33,0:05:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,真的遇到了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.46,0:05:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,筆記上寫的向點心時間前進
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.63,0:05:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,應該是向15點的方向吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.43,0:05:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,羽依里你真聰明
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.31,0:05:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,這條線路的盡頭會有洞窟嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.60,0:05:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,希望如此吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.19,0:05:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,好熱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.36,0:05:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.37,0:05:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,要不要到陰涼的地方休息一下…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.08,0:05:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,鷗?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.29,0:05:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,鷗!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.25,0:06:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.21,0:06:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,鷗!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.01,0:06:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好熱啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.89,0:06:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,真是酷熱
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.73,0:06:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我說  還要走多久呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.69,0:06:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,鷗同學  請快一點
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.41,0:06:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.66,0:06:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我想邊走邊看風景
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.45,0:06:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你們先走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.71,0:06:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,是因為這個太重了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.63,0:06:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我幫你提
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.67,0:06:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不用  我自己提
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.46,0:06:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,別囉嗦了  快給我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.51,0:06:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不要啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.72,0:06:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  快給…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.47,0:06:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.35,0:06:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.01,0:06:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你們先過去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.48,0:06:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想給你們添麻煩
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.02,0:07:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,拜託你們先走
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.36,0:07:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,羽依里?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.98,0:07:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,羽依里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.28,0:07:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,鷹原羽依里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.61,0:07:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.20,0:07:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我看你好像在發呆
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.08,0:07:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不是  你跑到哪裡去了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.37,0:07:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直跟在你後面啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.63,0:07:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.22,0:07:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,已經走了好久了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.43,0:07:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,還沒到嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.64,0:07:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,走了這麼久還沒找到的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.19,0:07:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,洞窟
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.07,0:07:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,是洞窟
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.98,0:07:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.40,0:07:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.21,0:08:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.09,0:08:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.01,0:08:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.43,0:08:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,腳很痛嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.30,0:08:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  不過沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.85,0:08:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,很快就會恢復了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.39,0:08:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你騙人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.60,0:08:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,從中午開始就開始痛了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.27,0:08:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你一直不肯讓我提箱子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.82,0:08:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,是為了用它當拐杖吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.86,0:08:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.37,0:08:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼要瞞著我啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.83,0:08:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.88,0:08:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,要被做色色的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.00,0:08:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不會做呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.51,0:08:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,說起來  羽依里你睡得好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.47,0:08:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,託你的福
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.09,0:08:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那個  我能問一件事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.72,0:09:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我雖然也睡得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.35,0:09:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,但是出了好多汗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.02,0:09:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.40,0:09:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,然後呢  我看那邊有個小池塘
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.57,0:09:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.57,0:09:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.78,0:09:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我就想稍微去洗個澡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.55,0:09:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,哎奇怪  怎麼有水聲
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.63,0:09:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼回事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.22,0:09:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,開玩笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.01,0:09:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.06,0:09:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好像有什麼很大的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.19,0:09:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,確實有…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.90,0:09:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,巨大的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.03,0:09:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你說哪裡有什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.49,0:09:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,在那片的岩石附近
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.49,0:10:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡該不會是那傢伙喝水的地方吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.33,0:10:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,在平時喝水的地方看到有你在
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.67,0:10:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,所以興奮了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.12,0:10:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.21,0:10:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,因為看到我所以興奮…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.09,0:10:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,唉?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.96,0:10:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,唉?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.05,0:10:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,別誤會  不是在說我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.93,0:10:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不要…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.56,0:10:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你沒看到吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.48,0:10:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你指什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.15,0:10:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.90,0:10:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,各種地方
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.15,0:10:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我沒看見
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.40,0:10:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,騙人的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.70,0:10:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,看到了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.82,0:10:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不想看都難啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.83,0:10:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,看到什麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.45,0:10:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.96,0:10:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,胸…咳
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.29,0:10:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,出現了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.29,0:10:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,莫名其妙發作的胸咳嗽
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.13,0:11:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然現在才這麼問有點晚
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.43,0:11:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,但走進禁止進入的洞窟會很危險吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.51,0:11:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,但都到這裡了  擔心也沒用吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.18,0:11:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不  擔心才正常吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.23,0:11:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我就算一個人也要去哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.48,0:11:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的  就知道你會這麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.03,0:11:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,和以前一樣啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.20,0:11:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼和以前一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.99,0:11:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事  別在意
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.41,0:11:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,就這麼一直往前走就行了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.62,0:11:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,應該是的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.92,0:11:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我記得入口走300米左右
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.71,0:11:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,有一處地方會突然變窄
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.30,0:11:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,是這裡嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.97,0:11:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,是這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.22,0:11:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,穿過這裡就是很寬敞的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.48,0:11:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.81,0:11:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,可以從這裡穿過去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.81,0:11:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,那我先過去了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.94,0:11:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.45,0:12:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,難道說  我曾經來過這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.51,0:12:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,現在該往哪邊走
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.30,0:12:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那邊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.13,0:12:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,再往前一點有條小河
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.14,0:12:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.68,0:12:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你的腳…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.02,0:12:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,還好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.52,0:12:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼問起這個
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.61,0:12:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,只是突然想起
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.82,0:12:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,說到底那個行李箱
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.36,0:12:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不就是因為你腿腳不好才提著的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.45,0:12:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼這樣說
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.91,0:12:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我…沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.70,0:12:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我腿腳不好的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.04,0:12:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼會來這種地方
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.21,0:12:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,說的也是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.79,0:12:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,那你為什麼要拉著它
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.21,0:12:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.84,0:13:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不…不告訴你哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.84,0:13:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不  我想知道
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.34,0:13:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我們是一起探險的夥伴吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.80,0:13:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,探險會伴隨著危險
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.26,0:13:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,要是有所隱瞞
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.93,0:13:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,會給大家帶來麻煩的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.56,0:13:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然說是大家
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.98,0:13:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,也只有你和我啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.31,0:13:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.27,0:13:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,其實…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.82,0:13:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我從小常常會腳痛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.07,0:13:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,特別是寒冷天氣的早晨和夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.99,0:13:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,是這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.45,0:13:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起這件事瞞著你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.33,0:13:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起這件事瞞著你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.92,0:13:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你說住過院
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.46,0:13:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,是因為生病嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.88,0:13:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,是  平時只是稍微行走不便
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.59,0:13:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,偶爾會痛到喘不過氣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.72,0:13:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,有時候還會渾身無力
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.18,0:13:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,開什麼玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.89,0:13:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.06,0:13:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,都這樣了還要做這種事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.02,0:13:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.65,0:14:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我感覺狀態還可以
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.61,0:14:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,就想著沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.03,0:14:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,天一亮就往回走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.82,0:14:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不…不要
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.99,0:14:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,別說傻話
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.61,0:14:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你這樣還打算進洞窟嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.24,0:14:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.91,0:14:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,拜託你了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.16,0:14:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想半途而廢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.17,0:14:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道你會這麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.88,0:14:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,反正  都走到這裡了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.59,0:14:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,往前走往後走都是走
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.30,0:14:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.18,0:14:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微休息一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.85,0:14:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我問你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.02,0:14:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,羽依里是為什麼來這座小島的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.98,0:14:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼突然問起這個
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.65,0:14:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,因為感覺光是我一個人被問
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.19,0:14:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,有點不甘心呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.44,0:14:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.03,0:14:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我說過是來療傷的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.28,0:14:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是說你受傷了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.66,0:14:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,算是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.78,0:14:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,具體呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.28,0:14:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼非要談這種個人的問題
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.83,0:14:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,因為我想知道  不准有隱瞞
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.83,0:15:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,真受不了你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.00,0:15:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,社團活動搞砸了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.65,0:15:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,搞砸什麼了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.44,0:15:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,概括地說就是辜負了大家的期待
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.15,0:15:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,所以逃到這裡了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.03,0:15:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,逃…嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.78,0:15:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,差不多吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.24,0:15:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.12,0:15:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,辜負了期待…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.91,0:15:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不過能讓別人有期待就已經很厲害了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.87,0:15:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,可能吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.29,0:15:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,但是落空的時候就會更痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.59,0:15:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.92,0:15:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有達到期待果然很痛苦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.76,0:15:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我說你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.10,0:15:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,就不能說點好話嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.47,0:15:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.77,0:16:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不是啦  剛才是在說我自己
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.85,0:16:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不是羽依里
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.69,0:16:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我果然還是有所期待
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.73,0:16:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然並不是我的本意
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.15,0:16:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,但越接近終點
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.24,0:16:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我越發覺到內心的那份期待
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.37,0:16:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,期待什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.33,0:16:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我期待遇到大家
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.04,0:16:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,期待海盜船還在這個洞窟的盡頭
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.67,0:16:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,說不定其中的誰已經先到了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.21,0:16:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,在那裡在等我…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.63,0:16:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我這樣期待著
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.38,0:16:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,但是說實話
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.34,0:16:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我也清楚那裡大概沒有人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.51,0:16:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我從小身體不好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.02,0:16:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,一直在醫院裡度過
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.60,0:16:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,幾乎沒有暑假出去玩的記憶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.19,0:16:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,所以對我來說
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.56,0:16:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,那次的回憶是很珍貴的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.78,0:16:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,但我明白對其他人可能並非如此
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.66,0:16:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,那個夏天只是大家無數回憶中的一角
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.03,0:17:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,被埋沒  被忘卻
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.12,0:17:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,可是  對我來說那是獨一無二的寶物
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.92,0:17:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,所以只有我才會這麼執著
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.05,0:17:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.09,0:17:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,差不多該出發了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.06,0:17:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.89,0:17:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,手電筒
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.23,0:17:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,沒…沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.11,0:17:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我馬上換電池
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.07,0:17:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,鷗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.45,0:17:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,鷗!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.88,0:17:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,羽依里!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.30,0:17:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,羽依里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.68,0:17:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,羽依里…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.93,0:18:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,羽依里…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.05,0:18:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事的  目的地應該快到了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.78,0:18:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,只要與你在一起  無論哪裡都能去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.87,0:18:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,哪裡都不去也沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.04,0:18:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,只要與你在一起  就能走遍世界各地
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.80,0:18:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不走也沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.43,0:18:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,哪裡都能去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.06,0:18:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,是光
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.06,0:18:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,是出口
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.19,0:18:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,到外面了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.27,0:18:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,有海的氣味
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.40,0:18:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.40,0:18:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.79,0:19:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,羽依里  你沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.92,0:19:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.34,0:19:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.05,0:19:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,被淹死可不行
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.30,0:19:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我可是游泳社的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.80,0:19:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,第一次聽說
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.14,0:19:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,確實
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.64,0:19:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是說在游泳社辜負了大家的期待吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.14,0:19:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,現在別提那個
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.35,0:19:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.60,0:19:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,另外  要是我說錯了的話先道個歉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.36,0:19:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我醒來之前
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.28,0:19:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,好像有人在親我…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.91,0:19:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,就是說  你幫我做了人工呼吸吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.91,0:19:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,人命關天
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.62,0:19:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不用害羞的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.67,0:19:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.71,0:19:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,人·命·關·天
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.30,0:19:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,羽依里  快看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.01,0:20:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,那邊能看到光
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.93,0:20:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,腳很痛嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.47,0:20:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.56,0:20:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,行李箱呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.52,0:20:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,掉進水裡時被沖走了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.73,0:20:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.52,0:20:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,扶著我的肩膀吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.31,0:20:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.82,0:20:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,就差一點點  我想自己走
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.20,0:20:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.74,0:20:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,但是慢慢走就好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.16,0:20:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.99,0:20:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,繼續剛才的話題
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.37,0:20:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,就是關於大家會不會忘掉回憶
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.50,0:20:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你可能太高估暑假了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.71,0:20:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你擁有的那種美好回憶
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.47,0:20:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,可不是不是那麼容易就能創造的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.30,0:20:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,比如為了找到海盜船
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.89,0:20:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,在小島上探險之類的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.14,0:20:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然我已經不是小孩了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.52,0:20:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,但現在我還是心情澎湃
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.40,0:20:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.44,0:20:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,羽依里不會忘掉今天的事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.98,0:21:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,應該不會忘吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.11,0:21:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我應該會永遠記得
Comment: 0,0:00:00.98,0:00:00.98,Comment,,0,0,0,,
